        "ggyz8AoIoY7_text": "<p>This is a <strong>daily longevity bottle</strong> designed to support long-term energy, mental endurance, and recovery — without relying on stimulants.<br>It works by supporting the body’s <strong>foundational systems</strong> (cellular energy, stress response, and recovery), not by forcing short-term “boosts.”</p>"
      },
